<title>UK: Norway's Statfjord crude loadings delayed - trade.</title>
<headline>Norway's Statfjord crude loadings delayed - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loadings of Norway's Statfjord crude in December and January have been pushed back by three days following maintenance at the Statfjord B platform earlier this week, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The delays were caused by problems restarting production after minor maintenance on Tuesday, they added.</p>
<p>&quot;We received a new official programme yesterday and all cargoes are delayed by three days,&quot; said one.</p>
<p>-- Tom Ashby, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
</text>
